 "text": "Hi, how you doing? Lots of older adults struggle with stairs. Have you asked at your local council for a free home improvement grant? Then look into stair lifts. They' much smaller than they used to be and come as new floor boards if needed. It' worth asking the stair lift company. They can often check without much commitment from you. Some lifts go outside the house on the outside landing. A small chair lift you can hold onto and push along or a rollator with a wheel is worth trying first.",
